    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4408f2b2109eba94cbdbb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而成田白仁以震撼人心的跑姿夺下第一名。\n观众的期待也到达最高潮，\n甚至有人喊出“她一定能前进凯旋门赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd17e0be7bb2ee751c22b7b75f977f0d2e4187fb4679e360eb81a3b038f82cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
