    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98d44a4f5caf6606b406adb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己在成田白仁休息期间仍不能停下脚步。\n她打算趁机拉近两人间的差距，\n按照原计划挑战“天皇赏（春）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecf938656a5651266bdec0591cb52d65facfca134a7e70f0f68a1eac4e009c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076437.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8108cc581900212d001d7b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怪物展现的梦",
