    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b18f742a1008c5f5cacebae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠倾注所有力气\n抵达了“天皇赏（春）”的终点。\n双脚的疑虑与恐惧都已然成为过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36d204482ee89a6528f210f6760037e055f30d2af0ced189daa6c24040c4b83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
