      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b87319e70e8dde2c76a5b1fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁一定很快就能重回赛道。\n樱花桂冠如此深信着，\n并埋头专注于自己的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7303b9c881c94c2d504d14acc8968ae78e57b8fb66f0576c0544b3322061d6cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a11623bef222bf15bb7b855",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0a81c90e31ed210ad6efee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前还不知道何日才有机会对决。\n但正因如此才得让自己随时处在迎敌状态。\n她开始努力为了“天皇赏（秋）”进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8dd83cb657333f6afcb05e4a9d25f07697517875c63b56a96086f029b75641",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076438.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3ae95ea16852d47d7252f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・期待的花蕾",
      "source_fingerprint": "8811d317cf3fd9b502da418fae75b7de4be486dc99555acb9bb436efc00e7ac5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076438.json",
