    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71d8b4b91e9c840a90411b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”──樱花桂冠表现精湛，\n却使成田白仁的状况低迷显得更加严重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d509df7bbefbafb509fa80ebb3a03c06803d924089348d318314273aaa7551",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076439.json",
      "json_path": [
