    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79572460f0c563efeb1cac2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而此刻樱花桂冠的表现仍不足以成为\n成田白仁眼中的“憧憬”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11a7d94190f67baff6bead54d1cdc2dbad6a78988936ddae497bd81ccf47e604",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076439.json",
      "json_path": [
