    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188a36066c277b6737a67651",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时樱花桂冠仍未放弃成为成田白仁眼中的光芒。\n因为过去的自己正是追逐着这道光芒走到今天的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02876889eddb35696c9c62917e6642753e991aa713a038bb0162d364ef661c35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076439.json",
      "json_path": [
